
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
S4 · Resources: server.registerResource + ResourceTemplate
SDK: registerResource, ResourceTemplate, client.listResources, client.listResourceTemplates, client.readResource, client.complete (ref/resource)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── Discovery ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▶ Static resources + instances listed by templates
  listResources()
  ✔ 4ms → 
    [
      {
        "uri": "academic://rules/grading",
        "name": "grading-rules",
        "mimeType": "text/markdown"
      },
      {
        "uri": "academic://reports/data-quality",
        "name": "data-quality",
        "mimeType": "application/json"
      },
      {
        "uri": "academic://tables/courses",
        "name": "courses.csv",
        "mimeType": "text/csv"
      },
      {
        "uri": "academic://tables/grades",
        "name": "grades.csv",
        "mimeType": "text/csv"
      },
      {
        "uri": "academic://tables/students",
        "name": "students.csv",
        "mimeType": "text/csv"
      }
    ]

▶ URI templates (students/{student_id} is readable but not listed)
  listResourceTemplates()
  ✔ 2ms → 
    [
      {
        "uriTemplate": "academic://tables/{table}",
        "name": "table",
        "mimeType": "text/csv"
      },
      {
        "uriTemplate": "academic://students/{student_id}",
        "name": "student-profile",
        "mimeType": "application/json"
      }
    ]

── Static resources ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

▶ Grading rules (markdown generated from config/grading.json)
  readResource({"uri":"academic://rules/grading"})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    [
      {
        "uri": "academic://rules/grading",
        "mimeType": "text/markdown",
        "text": "# Grading rules\n\nCourse total = 40% process score + 60% final score (10-point scale, rounded to 1 decimal).\n\n| Total (10-point) | Letter | 4-point |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8.5 – 10 | A | 4 |\n| 7.0 – < 8.5 | B | 3 |\n| 5.5 – < 7.0 | C | 2 |\n| 4.0 – < 5.5 | D | 1 |\n| 0.0 – < 4.0 | F | 0 |\n\n... (12 more lines)"
      }
    ]

▶ Data-quality report (rows skipped while loading)
  readResource({"uri":"academic://reports/data-quality"})
  ✔ 1ms → 
    [
      {
        "uri": "academic://reports/data-quality",
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"loaded\": {\n    \"students\": 40,\n    \"courses\": 10,\n    \"grades\": 261\n  },\n  \"skipped\": 7,\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"table\": \"students\",\n      \"line\": 42,\n      \"problem\": \"duplicate student_id 2201001\",\n... (85 more lines)"
      }
    ]

── Template with list callback: academic://tables/{table} ────────────────────

▶ table = courses
  readResource({"uri":"academic://tables/courses"})
  ✔ 1ms → 
    [
      {
        "uri": "academic://tables/courses",
        "mimeType": "text/csv",
        "text": "course_id,course_name,credits,faculty\nGE101,English 1,2,General Education\nGE102,Calculus,3,General Education\nCS101,Introduction to Programming,3,Information Technology\nCS102,Data Structures,3,Information Technology\nCS201,Databases,4,Information Technology\nCS202,Computer Networks,3,Information Technology\nBA101,Principles of Management,3,Business Administration\nBA102,Microeconomics,3,Business Administration\nBA201,Marketing,4,Business Administration\nBA202,Business Statistics,3,Business Administration\n"
      }
    ]

▶ table = nope → ResourceNotFoundError
  readResource({"uri":"academic://tables/nope"})
  ✖ 1ms → ProtocolError (code -32602): Unknown table "nope"

── Template without list callback: academic://students/{student_id} ──────────

▶ student_id = 2201010 (weak student with retakes)
  readResource({"uri":"academic://students/2201010"})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    [
      {
        "uri": "academic://students/2201010",
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"student_id\": \"2201010\",\n  \"full_name\": \"Trần Đức Phúc\",\n  \"gender\": \"Male\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2004-07-02\",\n  \"class_id\": \"IT01\",\n  \"faculty\": \"Information Technology\",\n  \"enrollment_year\": \"2022\",\n  \"email\": \"phuc.2201010@example.edu.vn\",\n  \"cumulative\": {\n    \"gpa\": 2.06,\n    \"classification\": \"Average\",\n... (28 more lines)"
      }
    ]

▶ student_id = 9999999 → ResourceNotFoundError
  readResource({"uri":"academic://students/9999999"})
  ✖ 1ms → ProtocolError (code -32602): Unknown student "9999999"

▶ URI matching no resource at all
  readResource({"uri":"academic://unknown/thing"})
  ✖ 1ms → ProtocolError (code -32602): Resource not found: academic://unknown/thing

